                    91.0,
                    497.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We wish to suggest state here a the structure for the salt of deoxyribose nucleic acid (D.N.A.) … A structure for nucleic acid has already been proposed by Pauling and Corey … In our opinion, [T]his structure is unsatisfactory for two reasons: (1) We believe that [T]he material which gives the X-ray diagrams is the salt, not the free acid … (2) Some of [T]he van der Waals distances appear to be are too small.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
                510,
                755,
                658
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    125.0,
                    510.0
                ],
                [
                    755.0,
                    510.0
                ],
                [
                    755.0,
                    658.0
                ],
                [
                    125.0,
                    658.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Confident writers use intensifiers less often than they use hedges because they want to avoid sounding as assertive as this:",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                672,
                783,
                724
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    672.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    672.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    724.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    724.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For a century now, all liberals have argued against any censorship of art, and every court has found their arguments so completely persuasive that not a person any longer remembers how they were countered. As a result, today, censorship is totally a thing of the past.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
                736,
                755,
                836
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    125.0,
                    736.0
                ],
                [
                    755.0,
                    736.0
                ],
                [
                    755.0,
                    836.0
                ],
                [
                    125.0,
                    836.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Some writers think that kind of aggressive style is persuasive. Quite the opposite. If you state a claim moderately, readers are more likely to consider it thoughtfully:",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                850,
                784,
                927
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 11,
            "global_block_id": 11,
            "global_group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    850.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    850.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    927.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    927.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For about a century now, many liberals have argued against censorship of art, and most courts have found their arguments persuasive enough that few people remember exactly how they were countered. As a result, today, censorship is virtually a thing of the past.",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                939,
                754,
                1039
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 12,
